  <ul>
    <li><a href="/acne-treatment-pharmacy/"><strong>Acne</strong></a>: what causes breakouts, and which pharmacy options can help.</li>
    <li><a href="/athletes-foot-treatment/"><strong>Athlete’s foot</strong></a>: how to clear it, and how to stop it coming back in Gold Coast humidity.</li>
    <li><strong>Cold sores</strong>: tingling, blisters and sun triggers. Our pharmacists can suggest treatments to use at the first tingle.</li>
