    <li><a href="/headache-relief/"><strong>Headaches</strong></a>: common types, what helps, and the warning signs to act on.</li>
    <li><a href="/heartburn-relief/"><strong>Heartburn and reflux (GORD)</strong></a>: what actually helps, and when to see a GP.</li>
  </ul>

