    <li><a href="/mouth-ulcer-treatment/"><strong>Mouth ulcers</strong></a>: home care, and when an ulcer needs checking.</li>
    <li><a href="/nail-fungus-treatment/"><strong>Nail fungus</strong></a>: myths, facts and treatments that work.</li>
  </ul>

