  <h2>When should I get help?</h2>
  <p>These guides are general information. If you’re unsure, symptoms are severe, or they aren’t improving, talk to our pharmacists or see a GP. <a href="/help-medical/">Help Medical</a> is inside our store. In an emergency, call 000.</p>
  <p>Always read the label and follow the directions for use.</p>
